00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:20,040
the gain surplus to the government,

193
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,360
and the gain surplus to

194
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,680
the bystanders who don't have to

195
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,320
breathe their smoke anymore or don't get

196
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:27,440
hit by your drunk drivers anymore or whatever.

197
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,200
So, that's the answer is.

198
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:30,920
So, when you count basically,

199
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,160
so when you count those people,

200
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,560
then again, it may be that you're

201
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,000
actually are increasing surplus by doing this.

202
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,040
Okay. All right.

203
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:41,800
Now, so last topic before we go,

204
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:44,240
