00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,320
Some of them coming all the way down

250
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,680
to assume the entire economy is monopolized.

251
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,960
And then what can we get it up to?

252
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,800
Right, and in the end,

253
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,520
I think the pretty standard view was that

254
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:33,200
Harberger did in fact reach a pretty strong result.

255
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:35,920
And almost the only, like the most memorable

256
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:38,600
critique of Harberger came from Paul Samuelson

